        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Spot Bitcoin ETFs recorded a $1.72 billion weekly outflow — their second-largest since launch — demonstrating that institutional redemptions can amplify crypto price dislocations rather than dampen them.",
